{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey to build, manage, and expand your settlement in Lysoria: The Settlers Path. As the leader, you\u2019ll guide your people through challenges, resource management, and strategic decisions to transform a humble village into a thriving kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct buildings, assign workers, and unlock new technologies as you balance growth, prestige, and happiness. With a rich blend of city-building, strategy, and simulation, Lysoria offers a deep and rewarding experience for fans of thoughtful management games. Can you lead your settlers to prosperity and leave a lasting legacy?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Home Sweet Home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3978310/72ccd2e7568a806632ede565071c2d080cc84546.jpg"},{"name":"Gotta Start Somewhere","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3978310/fb99593709626f9fd110f89e4345a8529014ab8f.jpg"},{"name":"Humble Beginnings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3978310/7cec2d973e85f76ead4a865796d69c2c1882ed48.jpg"},{"name":"Fit For A King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3978310/d6189d3d88f068a64dc60ddf861f92f4af44194e.jpg"},{"name":"Come One, Come All","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3978310/bc6f3a0b93f2a13ca130a6ca99c3ef1bdf00f3fe.jpg"},{"name":"We Need More Houses","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3978310/4f3e6dbaac4d604da038741d3061cbdfcb870fb6.jpg"},{"name":"Getting Cramped","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3978310/2edc98d061fd0385f0d3689ca51fb57d4a5c2fb0.jpg"},{"name":"You Call This An Army?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3978310/4c54c559e79bf5f30cae90dbaa